DTSTAMP:20260815T133111Z
UID:smcas-crestview-20260815@local-events
DESCRIPTION:SMCAS hosts a free public star party at Crestview Park in San 
 Carlos. All ages welcome. Members set up telescopes for public viewing of 
 planets\, nebulae\, star clusters and galaxies. Setup begins at sunset (20
 :01)\; observing starts one hour after sunset. Free.\n\nCancels in rain\, 
 clouds\, fog\, or high wind — no official cancellation notice is issued.
 \n\nAges: All ages / family\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcas.net
 /events/star-parties/crestview-park/\nLast synced: 2026-08-15 06:31 PDT
LOCATION:Crestview Park\, 1000 Crestview Dr\, San Carlos\, CA
URL:https://smcas.net/events/star-parties/crestview-park/
END:VEVENT
