BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SC] Water Rocket Rally
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T120000
DTSTAMP:20260815T133111Z
UID:hiller-10016512@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Water Rocket Rally\n\nUpcoming Dates\nSunday August 9\, 2026\n
 Sunday August 23\, 2026\nSunday September 27\, 2026\n\nDiscover the world 
 of rockets!\nBring a recycled 1- or 2-liter soda bottle or purchase a new 
 water rocket body in the Museum’s Gift Shop ($1.50/bottle) and join the 
 rocket workshop!  Use various common craft materials to convert a bottle 
 into a high-performance rocket vehicle\, then test fly it across the Museu
 m’s Courtyard on a fountain of compressed air and water.\n\nParticipants
  must bring a clean\, empty soda bottle (water bottles are not suitable fo
 r this activity)\, or may purchase one in the Museum’s Gift Shop on the 
 day of the event.\nGet your tickets\n\nThis Event is included with museum
  admission.\nMuseum Members are Free. Just show your membership at the doo
 r.\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.hiller.org/event/water-rocket-ra
 lly/2026-08-23/\nLast synced: 2026-08-15 06:31 PDT
