DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260819T200000
DTSTAMP:20260815T133111Z
UID:filoli-22106@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Chase the sunset at Filoli.\n\n\nSummer Nights brings a softer
 \, more laid-back vibe than Summer Stage. Think of it as the more chill li
 ttle brother.\n\nHeld every Wednesday and Thursday\, it is all about golde
 n-hour garden strolls\, drinks\, bites\, and live acoustic music in a rela
 xed midweek atmosphere.\n\nTickets: Adults $45\, Children 5–17 $35\n\nMe
 mbers receive 20% off\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/
 summer-nights-5/2026-08-19/\nLast synced: 2026-08-15 06:31 PDT
