BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[WS] Insider’s Garden Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T150000
DTSTAMP:20260815T133111Z
UID:filoli-20678@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Go beyond the garden gates with Filoli’s horticulture expert
 s. Step into the Greenhouses and Potting Shed\, wander the legendary 16-ac
 re Renaissance garden\, and get up close to the plants that define its cha
 rm. Come curious—our team is ready to share the insight and inspiration 
 behind Filoli’s living beauty.\n\nExperience Includes:\n\n90-minute guid
 ed tour with a member of Filoli’s Horticulture team\nExclusive behind-th
 e-scenes access\nGeneral admission to Filoli\nComplimentary beverage and a
  special keepsake\n\nTickets: $175\; includes General Admission \n\nMember
 s receive 10% off\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/insi
 ders-garden-tour-2/2026-08-20/\nLast synced: 2026-08-15 06:31 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/insiders-garden-tour-2/2026-08-20/
END:VEVENT
