 ff with Rabbit Hole Theater’s Miss Emu and Her Lost Characters—a story
  about a famous author in the Queendom whose storybook characters have run
  away\, and it’s up to us to help find them! Guests are encouraged to br
 ing blankets or folding chairs for a cozy forest theater experience.\n\nTi
 ckets: Free with General Admission\; reservation required\n\nMembers recei
 ve free admission\; reservation required\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https:
 //filoli.org/event/childrens-redwood-theater-miss-emu-and-her-lost-charact
 ers-2/\nLast synced: 2026-08-15 06:31 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/childrens-redwood-theater-miss-emu-and-her-lo
 st-characters-2/
END:VEVENT
